            <ArticleTitle>Safety of using montelukast during pregnancy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>881-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="QUESTION" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">Montelukast is used more and more by my patients with asthma. Is it safe to use during pregnancy?</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="ANSWER" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Cumulative data, including a recent Motherisk study, are very reassuring regarding the use of this drug to treat pregnant patients with asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
